Z||000000||FieroFanaticus2||12-30-2001||09:47 PM||||So I bought this stuff from wally world called OptiWhite.  I've got the stuff on my teeth right now and it feels like it's burning into my gums.  I looked in the mirror and it's all fizzed up and looks like splooge in my mouth.  I can't swallow cause the 'comfort' (yeah right!) trays are too big.  So I got this big pool of spit building up.  And the gel stuff tastes HORRIBLE.  Supposed to be mint flavored.  I've never tasted mint like this before.  Listerine is better tasting than this stuff is.<BR>Anybody else ever try an at-home-whitening system??  If so what brand and how did it work for you??||||reg||1
