Z||000005||LZeitgeist||12-30-2001||10:54 PM||||Yeah, I tried one of those kits called 'Natural White Rapid-White' - pretty damn disgusting. I tried it for a week or so, and I couldn't tell if it was making any difference or not, so I quit.  <P>I see the Crest White-Strips advertised on TV... like clear Scotch Tape you put on your teeth, supposedly with the whitening chemicals impregnating the tape... I might try those, but they seem pretty pricy. Probably not this month...<P>||||reg||1
